{"id":"naprotiv","lemma":"напротив","pos":"adv","rank":1267,"glosses":["(no,) quite the opposite; no, in fact...","on the contrary, in contrast, by contrast, conversely, on the other hand, however","rather, instead"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/60/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%B2.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%B2.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Наши родители живут напротив нас.","en":"Our parents live right across the street from us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655952","words":[{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},null,{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},null,{"g":"us","l":"мы"}]},{"text":"Что это напротив нас?","en":"What is that in front of us?","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"us","l":"мы"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"why"]]},{"text":"Я живу напротив.","en":"I live across the street.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},null]},{"text":"Она ждала напротив здания.","en":"She was waiting in front of the building.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to wait for","l":"ждать"},null,{"g":"building","l":"здание"}]},{"text":"Напротив моего дома есть магазин.","en":"There's a shop in front of my house.","words":[null,{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},{"g":"at home"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"shop, store"}]}]}